  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Natural Resources § 10–408(b)(2)): The Department may not prohibit a licensed bow hunter from openly carrying a handgun that the hunter is otherwise authorized to carry under § 4–203 of the Criminal Law Article if the bow hunter: (i) Is at least 21 years old; (ii) Is carrying the handgun for personal protection; and (iii) Does not use the handgun to kill wildlife wounded by a vertical bow or crossbow."
